		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Gadget</strong> &middot; <em>Engineer invention powered by Toolbelt scraps. Activate for 1 scrap; spend a 2nd scrap for the Toolbelt effect. Only Engineers gain the active benefit &mdash; an ally given this gadget gains only the Passive.</em></p><hr><p><strong>Reaction (1 scrap):</strong> Range 6, Reaction: when an enemy enters a space in Range. Damage STRd8 Force on a failed DEX save, half damage on success. Adjacent enemies take equal damage. Ignores armor.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 scraps):</strong> The first target is launched back INT spaces on a failed save if they are Large or smaller.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You take half damage from your own explosives.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Using the gadget spends 1 Toolbelt scrap — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] DEX save: STRd8 Force on a fail, half on a save (ignores armor); the Burst 1 template covers the adjacent enemies.</em></p><p><em>[A] The Toolbelt upgrade is the separate \"Hidden Mine (Toolbelt)\" feature (2 scraps total); the passive lives on the \"Hidden Mine\" gadget feature, so it works even if this item is unequipped.</em></p><p><em>[A] Keep the gadget equipped: Nimble switches off an unequipped object's rules, so its scrap cost would not be charged.</em></p>",
